# fns that still run inside the emitter, as `file:fn`.  This list only
# shrinks: a new check goes on Sema (ritz1/ARCHITECTURE.md, "Where a new
# check goes"), and moving one off the emitter deletes its entries here.
# tools/test_ritz1_emitter_check_freeze.py holds the two in step.  Each
# remaining move is a child ticket of #1816.  A blank line separates each
# module's group (#3903) so neighbouring moves never touch adjacent lines;
# a move deletes only its entry lines and leaves the blank lines alone.

